<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10673" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίφραξις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιφράσσω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>barricading,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆς ἀ.</span>
			<i>the interposition</i> of the earth, so as to cause a lunar
			eclipse, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>APo.</u>
				90a16
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mete.</u>
				367b21
			</span></i>; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥλιον ἐκλείπειν σελήνης ἀντιφράξει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					210
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.169a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pythag.
			</span></i> name for <i>seventeenth day of the month,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				367f
			</span></i>.</div>
